NOT AFFILIATED WITH BLIZZARD ENTERTAINMENT.

World of Warcraft and Blizzard Entertainment are trademarks or registered
trademarks of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.

reference/api/ is generated from the API documentation shipped inside the
World of Warcraft client (Blizzard_APIDocumentation, the system behind the
in-game /api command). It contains function names, argument names, type names
and return names. Blizzard's prose documentation strings are deliberately not
included. The generator is in tools/, so anyone can reproduce or extend this
against their own client.

Thunderz96/forever-addon-kit (MIT) was used to corroborate the initial API
surface findings in research/findings.md section 0.
